{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーのブログです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6都市12公演駆け抜けましたーー !"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1ヶ月半くらいだったかな、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あっという間でしたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡公演　7/23.24"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobALgE3i.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobuY2XPL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobVowvy0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアー初日だったので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "探り探りでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初披露の楽曲があると皆さん嬉しそうにしてくれるね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それが嬉しい。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ああいう風にペンライトとか声とか"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それぞれの方法で、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気持ちを伝えてくださるのが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凄く嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ケータリングは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とろろ　が1番美味しかった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とろろ卵かけご飯 をしました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸公演　7/28.29"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobeSnrp7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸、上手く飛べなかった…"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも増本さんと凪と写真撮れて嬉しいーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moblIu5HG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "瞳月がMCで話してた小籠包。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(研修期間2回ほど一緒に神戸に行っていて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その時に食べた小籠包が美味しかった　っていうお話です)"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "フォルダ見返したら小籠包の写真だけ残ってた"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島公演　8/8.9"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobUUuTvp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobhzZyJ2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobJU3qSs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドライフルーツ、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人で踊る所どきどきだったね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "千葉公演　8/15.16"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobYKF5y1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "千葉ジャンプし忘れた…"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "完全に忘れてましたー…   悔しい !"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも守屋さんと写真を撮れたので満足です"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪型、クマですか？って聞いたら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫！　と言われました。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫さんです　可愛いです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個人的にだけど、四期生ライブの時に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見やすい会場だなーーと思っていたので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この会場でライブをさせていただけて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮城公演　8/22.23"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobbklPA0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アンコール衣装で撮る時間が無さそうだったので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハーサルの服でジャンプしました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛季上手すぎるね。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob9LU6yR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ケータリングの場所に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなものがあった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大沼さんが撮ってくださいました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob0ovOtw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブの帰りに偶然花火を見れました !"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三期生だけの車両だったので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三期生と見れて嬉しい"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って言ったら、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しいーー分かるー！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って言ってくれました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し恥ずかしい事も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同期には照れずに言えます~"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏のいい思い出になりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "香川公演　8/29.30"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobajdhSR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobDq2cfX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏鈴さんお誕生日 !"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんの声が凄く力になっていました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブを一緒に作ってくださり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年のツアーも最高に楽しかったです~"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobhK5Lkw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobLC2Vho.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂と過ごす夏、たのしかったですか ?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}], "source": "official"}